# QUIRK (Q-12). Sample-rate snapping starts from candidate 0 and only replaces it when a
# listed rate is strictly closer than the current candidate. An output rate that is closer
# to 0 than to every listed rate stays unchanged (unsupported); otherwise the closest
# listed rate wins and ties keep the earlier list entry.
data D
aud_defaults D
aud_formats fltp
aud_rates 44100,48000
audio 2 2 8000
aud_create aac D
audio 2 2 22000
aud_create aac D
audio 2 2 22050
aud_create aac D
audio 2 2 22051
aud_create aac D
audio 2 2 46050
aud_create aac D
audio 2 2 46049
aud_create aac D
